# Built binaries
# The built binary at the repo root only. Without the leading slash this
# pattern matches any path component, which silently swallowed the whole
# cmd/gpscrape/ source directory -- already-tracked files kept working, so the
# only symptom was a new file there never showing up in git status.
/gpscrape

